{#
Custom prototype component: catalogue reference.
Mirrors the `.reference` style on the TNA beta catalogue record page.
See docs/custom-components.md

Params:
  reference (string, required) - the catalogue reference, for example "PROB 1/4"
  classes (string) - extra classes
#}
{% macro protoCatalogueReference(params) -%}
<strong class="proto-catalogue-reference{% if params.classes %} {{ params.classes }}{% endif %}">{{ params.reference }}</strong>
{%- endmacro %}
